{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or Be Found is an asymmetric co-op horror game. Go on heists as a pair of burglars looking for the most valuable items in haunted houses. Locate the specific item to earn money and progress, but have a look out during your search because you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either the hacker or the robber. Only the hacker knows what to steal and where to find it, and only the robber inside the house can grab it. Communication is key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hacker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hacker, you are the only one who knows what the item looks like, where it is, and when the monster is nearby. You must guide the robber using maps and cameras.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Describe the item</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Robber</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the robber, locate your way around the house, bring back the item described, and hide when the monster comes. Be fast and discrete, and don't make any mistakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate and steal the items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate your location</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Money, Upgrade Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the heist, use the loot to buy and upgrade your tools and gadgets. Raise the stakes and be prepared for everything.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more..!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only through communication can you and your partner in crime survive the horrors that await you. Visit different haunted houses, steal the cursed items ordered by the mysterious organization, and get out before you are caught. A horrible fate lurks in the shadows, ready to claim the life of anyone foolish enough to enter their domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special thanks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contributors to the compilation &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@YeenaGames / YouTube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@AndrewLaughsOfficial / Youtube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@dnnyfntm / Twitch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@Derogancia / Twitch</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Debt Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/c89247ca7c12db8bdfd6e04115cb55e1ddaa45cf.jpg"},{"name":"Double Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/f75e390cde7f5f1b756dd54dc07a1f43ba70b864.jpg"},{"name":"This is Only the Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/527b39d90268b47cb66618be0ad2cd286f142b7f.jpg"},{"name":"Are You Blind?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/13107d02458b9b75711fba566c2a72fe2ebf12b2.jpg"},{"name":"In the Nick of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/e8bf30eb03de12b35e1f166210b6bc71e6a1da90.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/6068be091dfa11d595129217685b5c2565ee814c.jpg"},{"name":"Master Burglars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223330/926dc692cb457dc08558706a8d4cf0736db7387f.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3223330?t=1771939716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3223330?t=1771939716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/dcd185749da2ef8b6927376cbc396efb192dcf2a/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771939716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/dcd185749da2ef8b6927376cbc396efb192dcf2a/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771939716","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has semi-realistic atmosphere that sets up for a uncomfortable experience. Players will die in various ways and show blood doing so. There will be objects around that show dismembered body parts and sometimes with things in them."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find or Be Found is an asymmetric co-op horror game. Go on heists as a pair of burglars looking for the most valuable items in haunted houses. Locate the specific item to earn money and progress, but have a look out during your search because you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/01d43af45c07054e20151d79bebee075.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either the hacker or the robber. Only the hacker knows what to steal and where to find it, and only the robber inside the house can grab it. Communication is key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hacker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/0962fdd0181c22094530dedc05e27cf8.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hacker, you are the only one who knows what the item looks like, where it is, and when the monster is nearby. You must guide the robber using maps and cameras.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Describe the item</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Robber</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/fc02c5fca66722dcd66592699a9b484f.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the robber, locate your way around the house, bring back the item described, and hide when the monster comes. Be fast and discrete, and don't make any mistakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate and steal the items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate your location</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Money, Upgrade Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/c37808333b9ead07c692d2fab462358c.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the heist, use the loot to buy and upgrade your tools and gadgets. Raise the stakes and be prepared for everything.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more..!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.poster.avif?t=1771939716\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.webm?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/extras/a506f4191eeb0ef70bd31e0152e36e4e.mp4?t=1771939716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only through communication can you and your partner in crime survive the horrors that await you. Visit different haunted houses, steal the cursed items ordered by the mysterious organization, and get out before you are caught. A horrible fate lurks in the shadows, ready to claim the life of anyone foolish enough to enter their domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special thanks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contributors to the compilation &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@YeenaGames / YouTube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@AndrewLaughsOfficial / Youtube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@dnnyfntm / Twitc